{"3676080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "World In The Abyss", "steam_appid": 3676080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World In The Abyss</strong> is a survival game where you must fight for survival in a post-apocalyptic world created after an alien invasion. Surviving humans are left to live on open water and scavenge what remains of the old world. The world as we know it is slowly changing as mysterious creatures and strange flora take over. Is there any hope left for humanity, and can the invaders be stopped?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/fa7cb25a1e91f538d091ed4ff1f87e5f.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/fa7cb25a1e91f538d091ed4ff1f87e5f.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/fa7cb25a1e91f538d091ed4ff1f87e5f.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your floating home by scavenging resources left from the old world. Unlock, upgrade, and customize your home to help you survive. Grow farms, craft tools, manage scarce resources, and build boats to traverse the large open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/cf13a0c899a4207a6358edfc7eb91937.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/cf13a0c899a4207a6358edfc7eb91937.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/cf13a0c899a4207a6358edfc7eb91937.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you’ll need to defend your base and resources from raiders and looters. Plan your base and upgrade your defenses. Craft weapons, armor, and gear to defend yourself (and raid others).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/f49c1ddae5879002a98d3c4993593216.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/f49c1ddae5879002a98d3c4993593216.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/f49c1ddae5879002a98d3c4993593216.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ocean and encounter mysterious creatures lurking in the depths. Uncover new biomes and discover the location of powerful bosses. Craft a deep-dive suit and explore sunken cities and lost worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/2b7e5edf054ff5e14a45cca720034575.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/2b7e5edf054ff5e14a45cca720034575.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/2b7e5edf054ff5e14a45cca720034575.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGE AND FIND RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge what resources remain on islands, floating forts, and on the ocean floor. Collect and store resources vital for your survival. Use fishing and construct traps to collect food and water. Build drills and pumps to collect minerals, oil, and gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/34c51bd1104c1312950b09e4fa78775c.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/34c51bd1104c1312950b09e4fa78775c.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/34c51bd1104c1312950b09e4fa78775c.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>World In The Abyss</strong> is a survival game where you must fight for survival in a post-apocalyptic world created after an alien invasion. Surviving humans are left to live on open water and scavenge what remains of the old world. The world as we know it is slowly changing as mysterious creatures and strange flora take over. Is there any hope left for humanity, and can the invaders be stopped?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/fa7cb25a1e91f538d091ed4ff1f87e5f.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/fa7cb25a1e91f538d091ed4ff1f87e5f.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/fa7cb25a1e91f538d091ed4ff1f87e5f.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BUILD YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Build your floating home by scavenging resources left from the old world. Unlock, upgrade, and customize your home to help you survive. Grow farms, craft tools, manage scarce resources, and build boats to traverse the large open world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/cf13a0c899a4207a6358edfc7eb91937.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/cf13a0c899a4207a6358edfc7eb91937.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/cf13a0c899a4207a6358edfc7eb91937.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>DEFEND YOUR BASE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >To survive, you’ll need to defend your base and resources from raiders and looters. Plan your base and upgrade your defenses. Craft weapons, armor, and gear to defend yourself (and raid others).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/f49c1ddae5879002a98d3c4993593216.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/f49c1ddae5879002a98d3c4993593216.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/f49c1ddae5879002a98d3c4993593216.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FIGHT BOSSES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the ocean and encounter mysterious creatures lurking in the depths. Uncover new biomes and discover the location of powerful bosses. Craft a deep-dive suit and explore sunken cities and lost worlds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/2b7e5edf054ff5e14a45cca720034575.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/2b7e5edf054ff5e14a45cca720034575.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/2b7e5edf054ff5e14a45cca720034575.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SCAVENGE AND FIND RESOURCES</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scavenge what resources remain on islands, floating forts, and on the ocean floor. Collect and store resources vital for your survival. Use fishing and construct traps to collect food and water. Build drills and pumps to collect minerals, oil, and gas.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/34c51bd1104c1312950b09e4fa78775c.poster.avif?t=1779912710\" width=628 height=182 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/34c51bd1104c1312950b09e4fa78775c.webm?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/extras/34c51bd1104c1312950b09e4fa78775c.mp4?t=1779912710\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "The aliens have caused the oceans to rise, plunging the world into the abyss. Survive, craft, and explore this mysterious underwater world. Build your base, defend it against relentless waves of enemies, and dive deep to uncover the secret that could stop the alien invasion once and for all!", "supported_languages": "English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Arabic, Indonesian, Japanese, Korean, Portuguese - Brazil, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Spanish - Latin America, Thai, Turkish, Ukrainian, Vietnamese", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/1264fe58fe381a4aa12c07b7ddade290c12e5382/header.jpg?t=1779912710", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/2b89bc71cfb5b5eb1d146ffbc21dc246048a152c/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1779912710", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3676080/2b89bc71cfb5b5eb1d146ffbc21dc246048a152c/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1779912710", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Dual-Core 2.4 GHz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 560<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7<br></li><li><st